  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (TCA 39-17-1316(s)): (1) It is an offense to knowingly give, sell, lend, deliver, or otherwise transfer a firearm to a person when the transferor knows or reasonably should know that the person receiving the firearm is prohibited from purchasing or possessing a firearm under state or federal law.\nSECTION 1 (TCA 39-17-1316(s)): (2) A violation of this subsection (s) is a Class A misdemeanor."
}